{"title":"Mock AIME 2 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is a real number with the property that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/3/683bf6f16134ed7ec2d5f139dc46838cad44dd21.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+\\tfrac1x = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"77\" height=\"21\" />. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/6/7c6d63c1ee840e2960b8e34356c880fa7059cd84.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_m = x^m + \\tfrac{1}{x^m}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"114\" height=\"21\" />. Determine the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/9/b29699446f0faca3d3e99da1ee5cf1ec0ca70aa0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"17\" height=\"15\" />. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can calculate <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/5/bb53b97e3e0f441767043012f0e72a5001594759.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x^2 + \\dfrac{1}{x^2} = \\left(x + \\dfrac{1}{x}\\right)^2 - 2 = 3^2 -2 = 7.\\]\" width=\"306\" height=\"46\" /> Similarly, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/d/81d52885045a282be85eb4ad0e116ecf0dc50eb9.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x^3 + \\dfrac{1}{x^3} = \\left(x + \\dfrac{1}{x}\\right) \\left(x^2 + \\dfrac{1}{x^2}\\right) - \\left(x + \\dfrac{1}{x}\\right) = 3 \\cdot 7 - 3 = 18\\]\" width=\"474\" height=\"43\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/5/4a5d8cb8f4559bcb7f69faf8971ee712364ced6b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x^4 + \\dfrac{1}{x^4} = \\left(x^2 + \\dfrac{1}{x^2}\\right)^2 - 2 = 7^2 - 2 = 47.\\]\" width=\"330\" height=\"46\" /> Finally, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/b/ddba4f22258b80914f836b278a6901de20c3685f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x^7 + \\dfrac{1}{x^7} = \\left(x^3 + \\dfrac{1}{x^3}\\right) \\left(x^4 + \\dfrac{1}{x^4}\\right) - \\left(x + \\dfrac{1}{x}\\right) = 18 \\cdot 47 - 3 = \\boxed{843}.\\]\" width=\"499\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p>-MP8148\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_Pre_2005\" title=\"Mock AIME 2 Pre 2005\">Mock AIME 2 Pre 2005</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_Pre_2005_Problems\" title=\"Mock AIME 2 Pre 2005 Problems\">Problems</a></b>, <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/viewtopic.php?t=14769\">Source</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"Mock AIME 2 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 